This package is built from a fork of GenOffice
(https://github.com/genspark-ai/genoffice) and bundles GenOffice code, some of
it modified to run in a browser and to be embedded several times on one page.
Every change to an upstream file is listed, with the reason for it, in
web/UPSTREAM-CHANGES.md at https://github.com/mist4k3n/genoffice.

Third-party software bundled in this package, and the license text each one
requires, is listed in dist/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt (the editor) and
dist/frame/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt (the frame page). Both are generated from the
module graph of the build that produced them. The bundled Carlito font faces
are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, reproduced beside them in
dist/fonts/LICENSE-OFL.txt and dist/frame/assets/fonts/LICENSE-OFL.txt.

The GenOffice NOTICE attribution, as required by section 4(d) of the Apache
License, follows. The remainder of that NOTICE describes components this
package does not bundle -- the desktop installer's own notices file, the
downloadable font catalogue, Unicode data used by the PDF app, and test-only
XML schemas -- and is omitted as not pertaining to it.

